# Chiltepin documentation

For docs under `docs/`, follow `skills/chiltepin/SKILL.md`.
That file holds the authoring workflow and routes to the relevant references.

Run `node packages/cli/dist/bin.js block <type>` for fields and examples.
Run `node packages/cli/dist/bin.js check` after edits; fix errors and review warnings.
Build the CLI with `pnpm build` if its output is missing.
